        "created_at": "2013-08-13T16:22:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's my bet, matchstickman - it would make sense, given what info we have available at this point (which doesn't include a timeline for his death). They've been pretty clear there is the main daddy-Legacy-dies tinmeline and the alternate young-Legacy-dies-creating-Iron-Legacy timeline.</p>\n<p>Could be wrong, I suppose, but that just makes sense to me.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
