        "created_at": "2013-08-13T17:47:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We know that there is a mess with the timelines. Once these gets fixed, who is to say that one of the timelines that existed now will be the main one. I am thinking that whatever fixes everything will result in a timeline where neither Legacy or her daughter dies.</p>",
