        "cooked": "<p>Yep, we don't know. Someone does, but we don't.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\">  Maybe we can beg Christopher, Adam, and Paul to share while they're in Indy this week…</p>\n<p>(Personally, my bet is he doesn't die for quite a few years, but that's just my bet.)</p>",
